locale "zh_hans"

section "addon-checker-revised/options"
t("Token colors", "棋子颜色", "_t")
t("Creature tokens", "怪物棋子", "_t")
t("Use tokens for verified creature identities. Unknown creatures and unsupported appearances keep their native art. This setting is independent of terrain and HUD style, takes effect immediately, and is saved for future games.", "为已确认身份的怪物使用棋子。未知怪物和未覆盖的外观保留原版图像。此设置独立于地形和界面风格，立即生效，并保存供以后游戏使用。", "_t")
t("Enabled", "启用", "_t")
t("Disabled", "禁用", "_t")
t("Player token", "玩家棋子", "_t")
t("Show your main character as a neutral token chosen by race body and sex. It does not follow equipment or class. Shapeshifts, custom tiles and uncovered races keep their native appearance. Creature tokens must also be enabled. This setting takes effect immediately and is saved for future games.", "以按种族体型和性别选定的中性棋子显示你的主角。棋子不随装备或职业变化。变形、自定义贴图和未覆盖的种族保留原版外观。需同时启用怪物棋子。此设置立即生效，并保存供以后游戏使用。", "_t")
t("Board terrain", "棋盘地形", "_t")
t("Native", "原版", "_t")
t("Blockout", "简化", "_t")
t("Refined", "精修", "_t")
t("Cycle Native, Blockout and Refined terrain. Refined supports Trollmire, Old Forest, Slazish Fens, both Rhaloren Camp layouts, Dreadfell, both Norgos' Lair layouts, both Daikara layouts, The Maze, Heart of the Gloom, Sandworm Lair, Ritches Tunnels, The Deep Bellow, Last Hope Graveyard, Scintillating Caves, Unremarkable Cave, Unknown tunnels, Tempest Peak, Ruined halfling complex, Lost Dwarven Kingdom of Reknor, Escape from Reknor, Lake of Nur surface, underwater and dry stone grids, Ruined Dungeon, Blighted Ruins, Dark crypt, Golem Graveyard, Ardhungol, Mark of the Spellblaze, Unhallowed Morass, Abashed Expanse, Temporal Rift L1-L4, Murgol Lair, Southern Beach, Tranquil Meadow, Noxious Caldera, Old Conclave Vault, Ruins of Telmur, Elven Ruins, Vor Armoury, Briagh's Lair, Caverns to the hidden valley, Flooded Cave, Temple of Creation, Charred Scar, the Fearscape, Sher'Tul Fortress floors and walls, Rak'shor Pride floors, walls, doors and stairs, and selected stone floors, walls, doors and stairs in both Kor'Pul layouts, and selected town grids in Derth, Lumberjack Town, Last Hope, Elvala, Zigur, Angolwen, Iron Council, Shatur, Point Zero, Gates of Morning and Irkkk, and selected grids in Shadow Crypt, Tannen's Tower, Ithilthum, Valley of the Moon, Ring of Blood, Erúan, Gorbat Pride, High Peak, Grushnak Pride, Slime Tunnels, Sludgenest, Vor Pride, Tutorial, Dreams, and the Temporal Reprieve and Dreamscape planes, including town roads and farmland, levers, lever doors, candles, portals and lava floors. Rhaloren Camp combines forest and stone art on the same level. Blockout supports forest, Norgos' Lair snow-rock, Daikara and Tempest Peak rock and mountain wall, Daikara lava, Heart of the Gloom ground, creep, walls and exits, Sandworm Lair, Ritches Tunnels and Briagh's Lair sand, walls and exits, The Deep Bellow floors, creep, walls and ladders, and Scintillating Caves floors, walls and ladders, and Unremarkable Cave floors, walls and world exit, plus Ardhungol and hidden valley cave floors, walls and ladders, and Mark of the Spellblaze burnt ground, trees, lava and exits, plus void platforms and rift edges, and Lake of Nur, Murgol Lair, Flooded Cave and Temple of Creation underwater floors, walls, doors and stairs, plus Southern Beach, Tranquil Meadow and Noxious Caldera ground, trees, walls, water, props and exits, plus Charred Scar and Fearscape lava floors, lava and rock walls, and Sher'Tul Fortress floors and walls, and Rak'shor Pride floors, walls, doors and stairs; stone cells, including The Maze, keep native art. Unsupported grids keep their native art. Creature tokens use their own setting. Changes take effect immediately and are saved.", "在原版、简化和精修地形之间切换。精修模式支持巨魔沼泽、古老树林、斯拉伊什沼泽、罗兰精灵营地的两种布局、恐惧王座、诺尔格斯巢穴的两种布局、岱卡拉的两种布局、迷宫、黑暗之心、沙虫巢穴、里奇通道、深渊咆哮、最后的希望墓地、闪光洞穴、不起眼的洞穴、未知通道、风暴之巅、半身人废墟、瑞库纳·失落的矮人王国、从瑞库纳逃亡、纳尔湖的地表、水下与干燥石质格、废弃地城、荒芜废墟、黑暗地宫、傀儡墓地、阿尔德胡格、魔法大爆炸之痕、混沌之沼、次元浮岛、时空裂隙第一至第四层、穆格尔巢穴、南方海滩、宁静的草地、剧毒火山、古老的孔克雷夫地下实验室、泰尔玛废墟、精灵废墟、沃尔军械库、布莱亚的巢穴、通往隐秘山谷的山洞、淹没的洞穴、造物者神庙、灼烧之痕、恶魔空间、夏·图尔堡垒的地板与墙、拉克·肖部落的地板、墙、门与楼梯，以及卡·普尔废墟两种布局中已支持的石地板、墙、门和楼梯，以及德斯、伐木工人的小村庄、最后的希望、埃尔瓦拉、伊格、安格利文、钢铁议会、夏特尔、零点圣域、晨曦之门与伊尔克中已支持的城镇地格，以及阴影地宫、泰恩之塔、伊塞尔森·月之谷、鲜血之环、艾露安、加伯特部落、巅峰、格鲁希纳克部落、史莱姆通道、淤泥巢穴、沃尔部落、教程、梦境、时空避难所与梦境空间中已支持的地格，其中包括城镇道路与农田、拉杆、拉杆门、阅读蜡烛、传送门和岩浆地面。罗兰精灵营地的同一层可同时显示森林和石质棋盘贴图。简化模式支持森林格、诺尔格斯巢穴的雪岩格、岱卡拉与风暴之巅的岩地、山墙，以及岱卡拉的熔岩格、黑暗之心的地面、蔓延地、墙与出口、沙虫巢穴、里奇通道与布莱亚的巢穴的沙地、墙与出口、深渊咆哮的地板、蔓延地、墙与梯子，以及闪光洞穴的地板、墙与梯子，以及不起眼的洞穴的地板、墙和世界出口与阿尔德胡格和隐秘山谷山洞的洞穴地板、墙和梯子，以及魔法大爆炸之痕的焦土地面、枯树、熔岩和出口，以及虚空平台与裂隙边缘，以及纳尔湖、穆格尔巢穴、淹没的洞穴与造物者神庙的水下地板、墙、门与楼梯，以及南方海滩、宁静的草地与剧毒火山的地面、树木、墙、水域、摆设和出口，以及灼烧之痕与恶魔空间的熔岩地面、熔岩和岩墙，以及夏·图尔堡垒的地板和墙，以及拉克·肖部落的地板、墙、门与楼梯；石质格（包括迷宫）保持原版。未覆盖的地图格保持原版。怪物棋子有独立设置。更改立即生效并保存。", "_t")
t("Event aura grid", "事件光环地格", "_t")
t("Subtle", "柔和", "_t")
t("Moderate", "适中", "_t")
t("Show a subtle or moderate colored border on supported event aura grids when board terrain is active. Native terrain and unsupported grids keep their original art. Changes take effect immediately and are saved.", "启用棋盘地形时，在受支持的事件光环地格显示柔和或适中的彩色边框。原版地形和未覆盖的地格保留原有画面。更改立即生效并保存。", "_t")
t("Token facing", "棋子朝向", "_t")
t("Fixed", "固定", "_t")
t("Follow movement", "跟随移动", "_t")
t("Fixed keeps token artwork and its painted light direction unchanged. Follow movement uses native horizontal flipping when moving or attacking. Only covered creature tokens are affected; native appearances keep their own facing. This setting takes effect immediately and is saved. Smooth movement and twitch remain controlled by the native game options.", "固定模式保持棋子图像和绘制的光照方向不变。跟随移动模式会在移动或攻击时使用原版的水平翻转。只有已覆盖的怪物棋子受影响；原版外观仍使用自身的朝向。此设置立即生效并保存。平滑移动和抖动仍由原版游戏选项控制。", "_t")
t("Rare", "稀有", "_t")
t("Unique", "独特", "_t")
t("Boss", "首领", "_t")
t("Elite boss", "精英首领", "_t")
t("God", "神祇", "_t")
t("Change this rank badge color. Adjust the RGB sliders and preview the badge, then choose Apply. Colors are saved for future games. Normal and elite creatures remain unmarked.", "修改此等级徽记的颜色。调节 RGB 滑块并预览徽记，然后选择“应用”。颜色会保存供以后游戏使用。普通和精英怪物仍不显示徽记。", "_t")
t("Friendly ring", "友方圆环", "_t")
t("Neutral ring", "中立圆环", "_t")
t("Hostile ring", "敌方圆环", "_t")
t("Change the faction ring color. The player keeps a cyan ring with a white inner line. Friendly units have a solid ring, neutral units a dashed ring, and hostile units four notches.", "修改阵营圆环颜色。玩家保持青色圆环和白色内线；友方为实线圆环，中立为虚线圆环，敌方有四道缺口。", "_t")
t("Restore default colors", "恢复默认颜色", "_t")
t("Restore warm rank badges and the default green friendly, blue neutral and red hostile rings. The player keeps its cyan ring and white inner line.", "恢复暖色等级徽记，以及默认的友方绿色、中立蓝色和敌方红色圆环。玩家保持青色圆环和白色内线。", "_t")
t("Reset all", "全部重置", "_t")
t("Color", "颜色", "_t")
t("Adjust red, green and blue. Apply saves this color; Cancel keeps your current color.", "调节红、绿、蓝三色。“应用”保存新颜色；“取消”保留当前颜色。", "_t")
t("Apply", "应用", "_t")
t("Default", "默认", "_t")
t("Cancel", "取消", "_t")
t("R: ", "红：", "_t")
t("G: ", "绿：", "_t")
t("B: ", "蓝：", "_t")
t("RGB %d, %d, %d", "RGB %d，%d，%d", "tformat")
t("RGB %d, %d, %d     Hex %02X%02X%02X", "RGB %d，%d，%d     十六进制 %02X%02X%02X", "tformat")
